<div class="kmh-about-page">
  
  <!-- About Hero -->
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A, #111827); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 5rem 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">
    <div class="kmh-container">
      <span style="color: var(--kmh-gold); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em;">Our Story & Purpose</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: #FFFFFF; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0.5rem 0;">Re-engineering Culinary Technology.</h1>
      <p style="color: #CBD5E1; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
        Founded with a singular mission: to bring true commercial-grade durability, silent magnetic motor technology, and timeless modern aesthetics to home kitchens around the globe.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Statistics Grid -->
  <div style="background: var(--kmh-navy); color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2); padding: 3rem 0;">
    <div class="kmh-container">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; text-align: center;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); font-family: var(--font-heading);">100,000+</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase;">Active Kitchens</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); font-family: var(--font-heading);">4.9 / 5.0</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase;">Average Rating</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); font-family: var(--font-heading);">5-Year</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase;">Full Replacement Warranty</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); font-family: var(--font-heading);">99.8%</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase;">Customer Satisfaction</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Timeline & Values -->
  <div class="kmh-container kmh-section-padding">
    
    <div class="kmh-section-header">
      <span class="kmh-subtitle">Innovations Timeline</span>
      <h2 class="kmh-title">A History of Precision Engineering</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 5rem;">
      <div class="kmh-card" style="padding: 1.8rem; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); width: 80px; flex-shrink: 0;">2018</span>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); margin-bottom: 6px;">The First All-Metal Prototype</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #475569;">Our engineering team set out to eliminate plastic gearing in countertop mixers, creating our custom 750W planetary gear drive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-card" style="padding: 1.8rem; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); width: 80px; flex-shrink: 0;">2021</span>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); margin-bottom: 6px;">Launch of KitchenMixHaven Flagship</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #475569;">Expansion into professional blenders, espresso extraction systems, and artisan baking equipment across North America and Europe.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-card" style="padding: 1.8rem; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-gold); width: 80px; flex-shrink: 0;">2026</span>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); margin-bottom: 6px;">Next-Gen Smart Sensor Appliances</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #475569;">Introducing real-time torque load regulation and smart thermoblock heating for consistent baking & brewing results every single time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="kmh-section-header">
        <span class="kmh-subtitle">Got Questions?</span>
        <h2 class="kmh-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-accordion active">
        <button class="kmh-accordion__trigger">
          <span>What makes KitchenMixHaven mixers different from standard store brands?</span>
          <span>↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kmh-accordion__content">
          <p>Unlike standard store brands that use nylon/plastic internal gears, KitchenMixHaven uses 100% heat-treated steel planetary gears housed in heavy die-cast metal frames. This ensures long-term torque without overheating or stripping during stiff dough mixing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-accordion">
        <button class="kmh-accordion__trigger">
          <span>How does the 5-Year Luxury Warranty work?</span>
          <span>↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kmh-accordion__content">
          <p>Our 5-Year Warranty covers complete repair or direct replacement of any defective mechanical or electronic component. If your appliance experiences a issue, we cover two-way expedited shipping and repair turnaround.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Main About",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
